  "description": "Phantom Graffiti is a bold and rebellious hand-brushed graffiti font that electrifies every visual with its urban soul.\nDesigned with energetic brush strokes and thick monoline consistency, this display font captures the essence of street culture, freedom of expression, and youthful confidence. Its chunky letters are exaggerated with playful curves and graffiti flair, giving it a raw, authentic street style feel. The characters are purposefully irregular, resembling spray-painted tags on brick walls and urban skateparks, making it perfect for projects that require a strong personality and expressive attitude.\nWhether you use it with neon gradients, vibrant outlines, or black ink textures, Phantom Graffiti delivers impact and energy.\nPerfect for logos, youth-oriented branding, hip-hop event posters, streetwear merchandise, skate culture graphics, music cover art, and packaging for edgy products, Phantom Graffiti brings vibrant motion to every surface it touches. The font set includes uppercase, numerals, and essential punctuation marks, making it versatile for both print and digital designs.\nUse Phantom Graffiti to tell stories of rebellion, individuality, and bold creativity—designed for creatives who dare to be loud, bright, and unapologetically bold.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Phantom Graffiti is a bold and rebellious hand-brushed graffiti font that electrifies every visual with its urban soul.</strong></p>\n<p>Designed with energetic brush strokes and thick monoline consistency, this display font captures the essence of street culture, freedom of expression, and youthful confidence. Its chunky letters are exaggerated with playful curves and graffiti flair, giving it a raw, authentic street style feel. The characters are purposefully irregular, resembling spray-painted tags on brick walls and urban skateparks, making it perfect for projects that require a strong personality and expressive attitude.</p>\n<p>Whether you use it with neon gradients, vibrant outlines, or black ink textures, Phantom Graffiti delivers impact and energy.</p>\n<p>Perfect for logos, youth-oriented branding, hip-hop event posters, streetwear merchandise, skate culture graphics, music cover art, and packaging for edgy products, Phantom Graffiti brings vibrant motion to every surface it touches. The font set includes uppercase, numerals, and essential punctuation marks, making it versatile for both print and digital designs.</p>\n<p>Use Phantom Graffiti to tell stories of rebellion, individuality, and bold creativity—designed for creatives who dare to be loud, bright, and unapologetically bold.</p>",
